        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "34-6-2 No later than February 1 of each year, all schools will have determined, with their area administrator, the projected number of positions authorized, including the number of staff vacancies or surplus. Teachers who have been identified as potential involuntary transferees will be advised by March 15 each year of this possible transfer. Should the projected number of positions be reduced after that date, any additional potential involuntary transferees shall be notified as soon as possible.",
            "block_bbox": [
                93,
